        {
            "jpName": "ヒシアケボノ",
            "enName": "Hishi Akebono",
            "jpText": "わーい！　2人とも、\r\nわざわざお祝いにきてくれたのー？",
            "enText": "Wooow! You guys tracked me down \njust to wish me happy birthday?",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
